---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Ask Before You Book"
  description="How Ask Before You Book handles emails and form submissions. We do not sell leads or placement."
  hideBanner={true}
>
  <article class="privacy-page">
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: October 28, 2026</p>

    <p>
      Ask Before You Book provides free checklists and general information for homeowners and business operators.
      This page explains how we handle information you submit through forms on the site.
    </p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Checklist email forms:</strong> email address (required); first name and ZIP code (optional); optional “notify me of new checklists” preference.</li>
      <li><strong>Contractor request form:</strong> name, email, and a short description of what you need, plus the city and service context of the page you were on.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We do not ask for phone numbers on these forms at launch.</p>

    <h2>How we use it</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>To send you the checklist or respond to a contractor request.</li>
      <li>If you opt in, to email you when new checklists are added for your area.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Checklist subscribers are kept separate from any internal research or outreach lists.
      We do not sell your information, and we do not sell leads or placement to providers.
    </p>

    <h2>Who receives form data</h2>
    <p>
      Forms are processed by FormSubmit.co and delivered to our inbox. We do not publish submissions or turn them into paid listings.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
    <p>
      We use Umami analytics (privacy-friendly, no personal profiling for ads). The site does not use advertising trackers for selling leads.
    </p>

    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>
      Unsubscribe anytime using the link in our emails, or email us to request deletion of your address from checklist lists.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about this policy: <a href="mailto:kaelnventures@gmail.com">kaelnventures@gmail.com</a>
    </p>

    <p class="disclaimer">
      <em>This summary is not legal advice. Have a lawyer review privacy and consent wording before relying on it for formal compliance.</em>
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .privacy-page h1 {
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }
  .updated {
    color: #64748b;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
  .privacy-page h2 {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }
  .privacy-page ul {
    margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem 1.25rem;
  }
  .disclaimer {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #64748b;
  }
</style>
